# Cabin

[wireguard]
interface: listen 51820, address 10.100.0.2/16
peer Home: key ReplaceHomePublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.1/32, 192.168.1.0/24, 10.100.10.0/24], routed, endpoint 203.0.113.10:51820, keepalive 25s
peer Phone: key ReplacePhonePublicKeyAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=, allowed [10.100.0.100/32], keepalive 25s

[firewall]
mesh zone: input drop, output accept, forward drop
accept in Cabin.camera rtsp: tcp/554 from [10.100.0.100/32, 192.168.1.50/32] to [192.168.2.30/32]

[dhcp]
lease Cabin.camera: 192.168.2.30 for [aa:bb:cc:00:00:04]
